AMD ZYNQ Board Support Package

1. About this document
======================

This document provides common and non-hardware specific information.
Please refer to README.hardware for hardware specific information.

Dependencies
------------
This layer depends on the following layers supplied with Wind River Linux:
	oe-core
	wrlinux
	meta-xilinx/meta-xilinx-bsp
	meta-xilinx/meta-xilinx-core
	meta-xilinx/meta-xilinx-standalone
	meta-xilinx/meta-xilinx-standalone-sdt
	meta-xilinx/meta-microblaze
	meta-arm/meta-arm
	meta-xilinx-tools
	meta-amd-adaptive-socs/meta-amd-adaptive-socs-bsp

